<script setup lang="ts">
usePageMeta('纸上展览','欣赏经审核公开的原创剪纸作品，从一张纸的不同留白里寻找灵感。')
const route=useRoute(),q=ref(String(route.query.q||'')),search=ref(q.value),category=ref(String(route.query.category||'')),page=ref(Number(route.query.page)||1)
const {data,pending,error,refresh}=await useFetch<any>('/api/gallery',{query:{q:search,category,page}})
function update(reset=true){if(reset)page.value=1;search.value=q.value;navigateTo({path:'/gallery',query:{...(search.value?{q:search.value}:{}),...(category.value?{category:category.value}:{}),...(page.value>1?{page:page.value}:{})}},{replace:true})}
function turn(delta:number){page.value+=delta;update(false)}
</script>
<template><div class="wrap page"><Breadcrumbs :items="[{label:'纸上展览'}]"/><header class="page-heading split-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">A GALLERY OF LITTLE WONDERS</p><h1>一人一纸，各自生花。</h1><p>每一份心意，都值得好好展开。</p></div><NuxtLink class="btn primary" to="/studio">剪一张，来参展 ↗</NuxtLink></header><div class="filter-bar"><div class="filter-tabs" aria-label="作品分类"><button v-for="c in ['','花叶之间','几何之美','自由创作']" :key="c" :class="{selected:category===c}" @click="category=c;update()">{{c||'全部作品'}}</button></div><form class="search-form" @submit.prevent="update()"><label class="sr-only" for="work-search">搜索作品</label><input id="work-search" v-model="q" type="search" maxlength="80" placeholder="寻找一朵花"/><button>搜索 ↗</button></form></div><AsyncState :pending="pending" :error="error" :empty="!data?.items?.length" @retry="refresh"><div class="works-grid"><WorkCard v-for="w in data?.items" :key="w.id" :work="w"/></div><nav class="pagination" aria-label="展览翻页"><button class="btn" :disabled="page<=1" @click="turn(-1)">← 上一页</button><span>第 {{page}} / {{Math.max(1,data?.pages||1)}} 页 · {{data?.total}} 件作品</span><button class="btn" :disabled="page>=(data?.pages||1)" @click="turn(1)">下一页 →</button></nav></AsyncState><p class="gallery-note">标注“原创示例”的作品由项目制作，用于说明数字创作方式。访客作品审核后在此展出。</p></div></template>
